      "text": "both bond and free, 2 Ne. 10:16 (26:33; Alma 1:30; 5:49; 11:44; 4 Ne. 1:3). people of Alma1 delivered by power of God out of bonds, Mosiah 23:13. soul of Alma2 redeemed from bonds of iniquity, Mosiah 27:29 (Alma 36:27). Shiblon was in bonds among Zoramites2, Alma 38:4. all men that are in carnal state are in bonds of iniquity, Alma 41:11. those who say the Lord will uphold sinner are in bonds of iniquity, Morm. 8:31. he who supposes little children need baptism is in bonds of iniquity, Moro. 8:14.",
